  "stageId": "main_02-06",
  "title": "手すりを握る",
  "storyCode": "2-6",
  "avgTag": "戦闘後",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsData/jp/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_main_02-06_end.txt",
  "sourceHash": "47fa8e25b76b30553a3b29c3e3605696e4f1433dd345f81ca618dac8921c0c1f",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "第十八关（后）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "エクシア",
      "speakerToken": "char_103_angel_1",
      "operatorId": "char_103_angel",
      "portraitKey": "char_103_angel",
      "text": "あれ？　ちょっと～！　もしかして、あたしの出番ナシ！？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "テキサス",
      "speakerToken": "char_102_texas_1",
      "operatorId": "char_102_texas",
      "portraitKey": "char_102_texas",
      "text": "来るのが遅かったからな。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "アーミヤ",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#2",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "何はともあれ、みなさんが無事で何よりです。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "アーミヤ",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#2",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "さあ、そろそろ行きましょうか。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "アーミヤ",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#2",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "東側の建物に向かって、そこから下へ降りていけば、レユニオンに私たちの位置を悟られずに済むはずです。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ミーシャ",
      "speakerToken": "char_012_misa_1",
      "operatorId": "char_012_misa",
      "portraitKey": "char_012_misa",
      "text": "……もう、大丈夫……かな？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "アーミヤ",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#2",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "そうですね……今のところは。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "アーミヤ",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#4",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "……顔色が悪いですね。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ミーシャ",
      "speakerToken": "char_012_misa_1",
      "operatorId": "char_012_misa",
      "portraitKey": "char_012_misa",
      "text": "ううん、平気……ちょっと、めまいがするだけだから。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ミーシャ",
      "speakerToken": "char_012_misa_1",
      "operatorId": "char_012_misa",
      "portraitKey": "char_012_misa",
      "text": "このくらい……なんでもないよ。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "アーミヤ",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "そう、ですか。……ところで、話は変わりますが……ミーシャさんが龍門に来てから、どのくらいになりますか？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ミーシャ",
      "speakerToken": "char_012_misa_1",
      "operatorId": "char_012_misa",
      "portraitKey": "char_012_misa",
      "text": "大体、一週間くらい……かな。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "アーミヤ",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "一週間……ですか。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ミーシャ",
      "speakerToken": "char_012_misa_1",
      "operatorId": "char_012_misa",
      "portraitKey": "char_012_misa",
      "text": "うん。……前は、チェルノボーグにいたんだ。……でもある日、街に怖い人たちがやってきて……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ミーシャ",
      "speakerToken": "char_012_misa_1",
      "operatorId": "char_012_misa",
      "portraitKey": "char_012_misa",
      "text": "何が何だかわからなかったけど、とにかく皆逃げ出して……私もそれで、逃げてきたの。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "アーミヤ",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#4",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "その人たちは、レユニオンの構成員ですね……レユニオンは、チェルノボーグの街を攻撃していましたから。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ミーシャ",
      "speakerToken": "char_012_misa_1",
      "operatorId": "char_012_misa",
      "portraitKey": "char_012_misa",
      "text": "そう、だったんだ……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "アーミヤ",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "あなたは……そうなる前から、感染者だったんですか？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ミーシャ",
      "speakerToken": "char_012_misa_1",
      "operatorId": "char_012_misa",
      "portraitKey": "char_012_misa",
      "text": "どうだろう……わかんないや。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ミーシャ",
      "speakerToken": "char_012_misa_1",
      "operatorId": "char_012_misa",
      "portraitKey": "char_012_misa",
      "text": "でも……脚にこれが生えてきたのは、ここ数日のことなんだ。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ミーシャ",
      "speakerToken": "char_012_misa_1",
      "operatorId": "char_012_misa",
      "portraitKey": "char_012_misa",
      "text": "……それで、私……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ミーシャ",
      "speakerToken": "char_012_misa_1",
      "operatorId": "char_012_misa",
      "portraitKey": "char_012_misa",
      "text": "……っ、う……！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "アーミヤ",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#6",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "……ミーシャさん？　ミーシャさん……！？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "アーミヤ",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#5",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "ッ、医療班をこちらへ！　急いでください！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ],
